      "message": "I am not a fan of waiting forever, because that mean we may simply not raise any error never, just deadlock at some point.\n\nCould we instead crash the stack when this happen ? (and increase the time to 2000 if we are worried about this happening to often).\n\nSimply because having a crash is clear and give information, while having a bluetooth stuck can lead to a very hard to debug situation.\n\n@okamil@google.com, please let me know what you think here too",
